id: FEND15-3
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: list_parent_attrs
target: crates/web/src/engine_parts.rs
find: keyed_view_or_notice("ul", LOG_LIST_ATTRS.to_vec(), &F_LOG[0], items)
replace: fandhe_frontend_core::keyed::keyed_list("ul", LOG_LIST_ATTRS.to_vec(), F_LOG[0].name, items).expect("mutation")
expect-fail: 上流の_keyed_list_を呼ぶのは_list_policy_だけである
note: keyed_view を迂回して上流の keyed_list を直接呼ぶ
